    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm looking at some long term energy holdings for a client. with all the new carbon regs and stuff coming out of the eu and the us, do you think the shift to renewables is basically a done deal at this point, or is there still a massive risk in betting against fossil fuels?",
